      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 45A Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (a), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"total income; or\" dengan perkataan \"source of income;\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perenggan (b) dengan perenggan yang berikut: \"(b) the husband has no total income which can be aggregated with that of his wife; or\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (b) perenggan yang berikut: \"(c) an election has been made by the husband under paragraph 45(2)(b)\". Pindaan seksyen 46"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 46(1) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perenggan (f) dengan perenggan yang berikut: \"f/J an amount limited to a maximum of five thousand ringgit on fees expended in that basis year by that individual on himself for any course of study up to tertiary level in any institution or professional body in Malaysia recognized by the Government or approved by the Minister, as the case may be, undertaken for the purpose of acquiring law, accounting, technical, vocational, industrial, scientific or technological skills or qualifications;\". Pindaan seksyen 48"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_14__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_14__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 48 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_14__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (3) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: \"(3)(a) Where for a year of assessment any individual is entitled under paragraph (1 )(b), (c) or (d) to a deduction specified under paragraph (2)(a) or (b), as the case may be, in respect of a child over the age of eighteen years and the child is receiving full-time instruction at a university, college or other establishment (similar to a university or college) of higher education, or is serving under articles or indentures with a view to qualifying in a trade or profession, then there shall be allowed— (i) in the case where that individual is entitled under paragraph ( \\ ) ( b ) or (c) to a deduction, in substitution for deduction specified under paragraph (2)(a), a deduction of four times of the amount of deduction specified under that paragraph (2)(a); or (ii) in the case where that individual is entitled under paragraph (l)(d) to a deduction, in addition to a deduction specified under paragraph (2)(b), a further deduction of four thousand ringgit: Provided that in the case of a child who is receiving full-time instruction outside Malaysia, it shall be in respect of an award of degree (including a degree at Master or Doctorate level) or the equivalent of a degree. (b) For the purpose of paragraph (a), the instruction and educational establishment referred to in that paragraph shall be approved by the relevant government authority.\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_14__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_14",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong subseksyen (6). Pindaan seksyen 60"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 60 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subperenggan (3A)(b)(ii), dengan memotong perkataan \"(subject to any adjustment as the Director General may think fit to make in accordance with the provisions of this Act)\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_15",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subperenggan (4A)(b)(ii), dengan memotong perkataan \"(subject to any adjustment as the Director General may think fit to make in accordance with the provisions of this Act)\". Pindaan seksyen 60F"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 60F Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(1A) Notwithstanding any other provision of this Act, where in any year of assessment income of an investment holding company consists of— (a) income from the holding of investment, it shall not be treated as income from a source consisting of a business; or (b) income other than income from the making of investment, it shall be treated as gains or profits under paragraph 4(/). (1B) If it is shown that it has been established as between the Director General and the company for any tax purposes that the company is an investment holding company for the basis period for any year of assessment it shall be presumed until the contrary is proved that the company is an investment holding company for the purposes of this Act for the basis period for every subsequent year of assessment. (lc) This section shall not apply to an investment holding company referred to in section 60FA.\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_16",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (2), dalam takrif \"investment holding company\", dengan menggantikan perkataan \"wholly in the making of investments and whose income\" dengan perkataan \"mainly in the holding of investments and not less than eighty per cent of its gross income (whether exempt or not)\". Seksyen baru 60FA"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 60F seksyen yang berikut: \"Investment holding company listed on Bursa Malaysia 60FA. ( 1 ) The provisions of this section shall apply notwithstanding any other provisions of this Act. (2) Where an investment holding company is a company resident for the basis year for a year of assessment and listed on the Bursa Malaysia in the basis period for that year of assessment, income of that investment holding company from the holding of investment in that basis period shall be treated as gross income of that investment holding company from a source or sources consisting of a business for that year of assessment. (3) For the purpose of subsection (2)— (a) in ascertaining for a year of assessment the adjusted income of an investment holding company from a source referred to in that subsection, any amount of deduction to be made under this Act in arriving at that income shall only be allowed against the gross income from that source but— (i) where in that year of assessment that source does not produce any income, any deduction in respect of that source shall be disregarded for the purposes of this Act; or (ii) where that amount of deduction exceeds the gross income from that source for that year of assessment, the excess shall be disregarded for the purposes of this Act; and (b) in ascertaining for a year of assessment the statutory income of an investment holding company from a source referred to in that subsection, any allowance for that year of assessment falling to be made to that company under Schedule 3 in respect of that source shall only be available against the adjusted income of that person from that source and if by reason of an absence or insufficiency of adjusted income from that source for the basis period for that year of assessment, effect cannot be given or be given in full to any allowance for that year of assessment in relation to that source, that allowance which has not been so made shall not be made to that company for subsequent years of assessment. (4) If it is shown that it has been established between the Director General and the company for any tax purposes that the company is an investment holding company for the basis period for any year of assessment it shall be presumed until the contrary is proved that the company is an investment holding company for the purpose of this Act for the basis period for every subsequent year of assessment. (5) Dalam seksyen ini, \"investment holding company\" mempunyai pengertian yang sama yang diberikan kepadanya di bawah seksyen 60F.”. Peruntukan khas yang berhubungan dengan seksyen 60FA"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Walau apa pun peruntukan seksyen 60FA Akta ibu sebagaimana yang dimasukkan oleh seksyen 17 Akta ini, peruntukan seksyen 43 dan 44 Akta ibu hendaklah terpakai bagi syarikat pegangan pelaburan yang diperkatakan dalam seksyen 60FA Akta ibu berkenaan dengan kerugian larasannya, jika ada, atau suatu elaun yang disifatkan telah dibuat ke atas syarikat pelaburan induk itu di bawah perenggan 75 Jadual 3 Akta ibu yang mana kerugian larasan atau elaun itu telah ditentukan sebelum pindaan seksyen 17 Akta ini mula berkuat kuasa. Pindaan seksyen 75A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 75A Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan subseksyen"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "(1) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: \"(1) Notwithstanding anything contrary to this Act or any other written law— (a) where any tax is due and payable under this Act by a company, any person who is a director of that company during the period in which that tax is liable to be paid by that company; or (b) where any debt is due and payable from an employer under any rules made pursuant to section 107 and the employer is a company, any person who is a director of that company during the period in which the debt is liable to be paid by that company, shall be jointly and severally liable for such tax or debt, as the case may be, that is due and payable and shall be recoverable under section 106 from that person.\". Pindaan seksyen 91"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 91 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (3) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(4) Where in a year of assessment— (a) any assessment made in respect of a person for any year of assessment has been determined by the court on appeal or review; or (b) any exemption, relief, remission or allowance granted to a person for any year of assessment pursuant to any provision of this Act or any other written law in respect of income of that person which is subject to tax under this Act has been withdrawn, revoked or cancelled for failing to comply with any condition imposed in granting such exemption, relief, remission or allowance, the Director General may in the first mentioned year of assessment or within six years after its expiration make an assessment in respect of that person for any year of assessment for the purpose of giving effect to the determination, revocation, withdrawal or cancellation, as the case may be.\". Pindaan seksyen 95"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_21",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "21",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan seksyen 95 dengan seksyen yang berikut: \"Discharge of double assessment 95. Where two or more assessments have been made with respect to a person on the same income for the same year of assessment, the Director General may discharge such of those assessments as need to be discharged in order to ensure that the income is charged to tax once for that year.\". Pindaan seksyen 107c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_22",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "22",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 107c Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan subseksyen"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "(3) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: \"(3) The estimate of tax payable for a year of assessment shall not be less than eighty-five per cent of the revised estimate of tax payable for the immediately preceding year of assessment or if no revised estimate is furnished, shall not be less than eighty-five per cent of the estimate of tax payable for the immediately preceding year of assessment.\". Pindaan seksyen 111B"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_23",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "23",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 111B(3) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"of this Act\" perkataan \"or any other refund or payment required to be paid out of the Fund as provided by any other written law\". Pindaan seksyen 125"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_24",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "24",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 125(2) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan \"subsection 112(3)\" dengan perkataan \"subsection 44A(9), 112(3)\". Pindaan seksyen 127"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_25",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "25",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_25__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_25__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 127 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_25__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_25",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (3)(b), dengan memotong perkataan \"person or\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_25__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_25",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (3) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(3A) The Minister may, in any particular case exempt any person from all or any of the provision of this Act, either generally or in respect of any income of a particular kind or any class of income of a particular kind.\". Pindaan seksyen 134"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_26",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26",
      "hasPart": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_26__subsec_2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 134 Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan subsekyen"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_26__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan subseksyen yang berikut: \"(2) The Minister shall, after consulting the Director General of Inland Revenue, appoint, by notification in the Gazette— (a) two or more Deputy Directors General of Inland Revenue; (b) State Directors, Directors, Deputy Directors, Principal Assistant Directors and Assistant Directors of Inland Revenue; (c) Head of Revenue Solicitor, Deputy Revenue Solicitors, Senior Revenue Counsels and Revenue Counsels; and (d) such other officers as may be necessary and expedient for the due administration of this Act, from amongst the employees of the Inland Revenue Board of Malaysia.\". Pindaan seksyen 136"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_27",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "27",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_27__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_27__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_27__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 136 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_27__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_27",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (2) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(2) Any officer appointed under paragraphs 134(2)(7?J and (c), may exercise any function of the Director General under this Act (not being a function exercisable by statutory order or a function exercisable under section 152) except his function under section 44, subsection 137(1) and section 150.\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_27__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_27",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong subseksyen (3) dan (4); dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_27__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_27",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (5), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"under subsection (4) by Senior Assistant or Assistant Directors of Inland Revenue\" dengan perkataan \"under subsection (2) by the appointed officers\". Pindaan seksyen 146"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_28",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "28",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 146 Akta ibu dipinda dalam subseksyen (1) dengan memotong perkataan \", the Director of Inland Revenue, Sabah, or the Director of Inland Revenue, Sarawak,\". Pindaan seksyen 147"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_II__cl_29",
