        "@value": "Seksyen 54 mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Januari 2006. Pindaan seksyen 21"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_51",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "51",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Setem 1949, yang disebut \"Akta ibu\" dalam Bab ini, dipinda dalam subseksyen 21(2) dengan memotong perkataan \"or three ringgit as the case may require\". Pindaan seksyen 43"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_52",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "52",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perenggan 43(5)(b) dengan perenggan yang berikut: \"(/?) if it is stamped after the expiration of thirty days after it has been received in Malaysia, on payment in addition to the stamp duty of a penalty of— (i) twenty-five ringgit or five per centum of the amount of the deficient duty, whichever sum be the greater, if the instrument is stamped within three months after the time for stamping; (ii) fifty ringgit or ten per centum of the amount of the deficient duty, whichever sum be the greater, if the instrument is stamped later than three months but not later than six months after the time for stamping; or (iii) one hundred ringgit or twenty per centum of the amount of the deficient duty, whichever sum be the greater, in any other case.\". Pindaan seksyen 80"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_53",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "53",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_53__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_53__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_53__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 80 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_53__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_53",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (1), dengan memotong perkataan \"instrument or\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_53__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_53",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(1A) The Minister of Finance may in any particular case— (i) exempt from duty any instrument which would otherwise be chargeable under this Act; or ( i i ) reduce or remit the duties with which any instrument is chargeable\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_53__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_53",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (2), dengan memotong perkataan \"any instrument or\". Seksyen baru 80A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_54",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "54",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 80 seksyen yang berikut: \"Fund for Tax Refund 80A. (1) There shall be paid from time to time into the Fund established under section 111B of the Tncome Tax Act 1967 such amount of duty collected under this Act as may be authorized by the Minister. (2) The money of the Fund referred to in subsection (1), shall be applied for the making of a refund of any duty or any other payment required to be made by the Collector under this Act. (3) Section 14A of the Financial Procedure Act 1957 shall not apply to any refund of any duty or any other payment required to be made under this Act. (4) Where the Collector is authorized or required by this Act to make any refund of any duty or any other payment required under this Act, he shall certify the amount of the sum to be refunded or paid and cause the refund or payment to be made forthwith.\". Pindaan Jadual Pertama"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_55",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "55",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Jadual Pertama Akta ibu dipinda dalam butiran 22 dengan memasukkan selepas subbutiran (5) subbutiran yang berikut: \"(6) Being the security for securing the payment or repayment of money for the purchase of goods (within the meaning given under the First Schedule of the Hire Purchase Act 1967) in accordance with the Syariah principle of Al Bai Bithaman Ajil. Pindaan Jadual Kelima"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_56",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "56",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_IV",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Jadual Kelima Akta ibu dipinda dalam perenggan 8 dengan menggantikan perkataan \"Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange\" dengan perkataan \"Bursa Malaysia\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_I__cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini bolehlah dinamakan Akta Kewangan 2005. Pindaan Akta"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_I__cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967 [Akta 53], Akta Cukai Keuntungan Harta Tanah 1976 [Akta 169], Akta Setem 1949 [Akta 378], Akta Petroleum (Cukai Pendapatan) 1967 [Akta 543] dan Akta Cukai Aktiviti Perniagaan Luar Pesisir Labuan 1990 [Akta 445] dipinda mengikut cara yang dinyatakan masing-masing dalam Bab II, III, IV, V dan VT."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V",
      "@type": "akn:chapter",
      "eli:number": "V",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_57",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_58",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_59",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_60",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_61",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_62",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_63",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_64"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "PINDAAN KEPADA AKTA PETROLEUM (CUKAI PENDAPATAN) 1967 Permulaan kuat kuasa pindaan kepada Akta Petroleum (Cukai Pendapatan) 1967"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_VI",
      "@type": "akn:chapter",
      "eli:number": "VI",
      "hasPart": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_VI__cl_65",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "PINDAAN KEPADA AKTA CUKAI AKTIVITI PERNIAGAAN LUAR PESISIR LABUAN 1990 Pindaan seksyen 18"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_VI__cl_65",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "65",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Cukai Aktiviti Perniagaan Luar Pesisir Labuan 1990 dipinda dalam subseksyen 18(1) dengan menggantikan perkataan \"Timbalan Ketua Pengarah, Penolong Ketua Pengarah, Penolong Kanan Pengarah atau Penolong Pengarah, Hasil Dalam Negeri yang disebutkan dalam\" dengan perkataan \"mana-mana pegawai yang dilantik di bawah\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_57",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "57",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 60 dan 64 mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Januari 2006. Pindaan seksyen 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_58",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "58",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Petroleum (Cukai Pendapatan) 1967, yang disebut \"Akta ibu\" dalamBab ini, dipinda dalam perenggan 2(\\)(a), dalam takrif \"authorized officer\" dengan menggantikan perkataan \"(1), (2), (3) or (4)\" dengan perkataan \"(1) or (2)\". Pindaan seksyen 39"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_59",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "59",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 39 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (3) subseksyen yang berikut: \"(4) Where in a year of assessment— (a) any assessment made in respect of any chargeable person for any year of assessment has been determined by the court on appeal or review; or (b) any exemption granted to any chargeable person under this Act has been withdrawn for failing to comply with any condition imposed in granting such exemption, the Director General may in the first mentioned year of assessment or within six years after its expiration make an assessment in respect of that chargeable person for any year of assessment for the purpose of giving effect to the determination or withdrawal, as the case may be.\". Seksyen baru 50A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_60",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "60",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 50 seksyen yang berikut: \"Fund for Tax Refund 50A. (1) There shall be paid from time to time into the Fund established under section 1 1 1 B of the Income Tax Act 1967 such amount of tax collected under this Act as may be authorized by the Minister. (2) The money of the Fund referred to in subsection (1), shall be applied for the making of a refund of an amount of tax paid in excess of the amount payable as ascertained in section 50. (3) Section 14A of the Financial Procedure Act 1957 shall not apply to any refund in excess of the amount payable as ascertained in section 50.\". Pindaan seksyen 69"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_61",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "61",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_61__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_61__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_61__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 69 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_61__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_61",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (2) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: \"(2) Any officer appointed under the law relating to income tax may exercise any function of the Director General under this Act (not being a function exercisable by a statutory order or a function exercisable under subsection 70(1) and section 82).\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_61__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_61",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong subseksyen (3) dan (4); dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_61__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_61",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (5), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"under subsection (4) by Senior Assistant or Assistant Director of Inland Revenue\" dengan perkataan \"under subsection (2) by the appointed officers.\". Pindaan seksyen 77"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_62",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "62",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 77 Akta ibu dipinda dalam subseksyen (1) dengan memotong perkataan \", the Director of Inland Revenue, Sabah, or the Director of Tnland Revenue, Sarawak,\". Pindaan seksyen 78"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_63",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "63",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 78 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memotong perkataan \", to the Director of Inland Revenue, Sabah, to the Director of Inland Revenue, Sarawak,\". Pindaan seksyen 81"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V__cl_64",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "64",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/27/msa@/~chp_V",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan seksyen 81 dengan seksyen yang berikut: \"81. Where the Director General is authorized or required by this Act to make any refund or repayment, he shall certify the amount of the sum to be refunded or repaid and cause the refund or repayment to be made forthwith.\"."
      }
    }
  ]
}
